enables fast absorption and improved bioavailability of our ingredients, compared to oil-based and nano brands.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"text_block_eUVCcL":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/testing.png","image_width":60,"title":"Rigorous Testing","text":"<p>Crafted with transparent, premium ingredients that undergo <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/blogs\/news\/nextevo-inc-taps-coral-reef-labs-on-cbd-study-most-brands-50-off-label-claims\">rigorous testing<\/a> to ensure purity and potency.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"text_block_8MR4et":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/thcfree_dkblue.png","image_width":60,"title":"High-Free","text":"<p>NextEvo Naturals products are High-free and non-intoxicating. This ensures that users can experience the potential benefits without the unwanted side effects of feeling high from psychoactive ingredients.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["text_block_dfgeyp","text_block_eUVCcL","text_block_8MR4et"],"custom_css":["h3 {letter-spacing: 0em; color: #002d72; font-weight: bold;}"],"settings":{"title":"What Makes NextEvo Better","text":"","bottom_text":"","link":"","link_text":"","align_text":"center","padding":false,"wrap":false,"carousel":true,"background":"#f5f6fb","text_color":"#002d72"}},"advanced_content_RdncR9":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"image_GVpAQt":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_size":false,"height":80,"link":"","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"liquid_HaQqQ7":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<h2 style=\"color: 002D72;\">How Much Should I Take?<\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: 002D72;\">\n  When starting a new supplement regimen, we recommend beginning with \n  <b style=\"color: 002D72;\">10-20mg per day<\/b> for the first week to ensure it is well tolerated.\n<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: 002D72;\">\n  You can then gradually \n  <b style=\"color: 002D72;\">increase your daily dose by increments of 5mg<\/b> until you find your optimal dose, depending on what feels best for you.\n<\/p>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/how-much-cbd-should-i-take\" class=\"btn btn--secondary\" style=\"background: #002D72; color: #ffffff;\">See Our Dosage Guide                            <\/a><\/center>","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"dosage_chart_EVfnfH":{"type":"dosage_chart","settings":{"title":"How to Calibrate Your Wellness Dosage","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/dosage-icon.svg","color":"#4057a2","text_1":"","color_1":"#f5f6fb","text_2":"Determine your body weight","color_2":"#e4def4","text_3":"Start with 1-6mg for every 10lbs of body weight","color_3":"#a7bbe5","text_4":"Increase dose incrementally by 5-10mg at a time","color_4":"#d1e5e7","text_5":"Keep a journal to track your dosage and its effects","color_5":"#f5f6fb","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["image_GVpAQt","liquid_HaQqQ7","dosage_chart_EVfnfH"],"settings":{"id":"How to Calibrate Your CBD Dosage","full_width":true,"space_around":true,"margin_top":25,"margin_bottom":25,"padding_around":true,"padding_top":75,"padding_bottom":75,"background":"#f9f2ed","heading_color":"#002d72","text_color":"#002d72"}},"8eb80464-480e-4783-abec-e312dd953d35":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"template--16479110758573__8eb80464-480e-4783-abec-e312dd953d35-liquid-1":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<h2>How Much Ashwagandha Should I Take?<\/h2><p>When starting a Ashwagandha regimen, a good starting dose is <b>125mg<\/b> which is also the recommended dose for our Ashwagandha products. As with any supplement, it's always best to consult with a healthcare professional before starting a new regimen.<\/p>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/how-much-ashwagandha-should-i-take\" class=\"btn btn--secondary\" style=\"background: #002D72; color: #ffffff;\">See Our Ashwagandha Dosage Guide                            <\/a><\/center>","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"dosage_chart_FYgJHP":{"type":"dosage_chart","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"How to Calibrate Your CBD Dosage","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/dosage-icon.svg","color":"#4057a2","text_1":"Determine your body weight","color_1":"#f5f6fb","text_2":"Start with 1-6mg for every 10lbs of body weight","color_2":"#e4def4","text_3":"Increase dose incrementally by 5-10mg at a time","color_3":"#a7bbe5","text_4":"Keep a journal to track your dosage and its effects","color_4":"#d1e5e7","text_5":"","color_5":"#f5f6fb","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"image_9CFYhK":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ashwagandha_8x_more_powerful.png","enable_size":true,"height":400,"link":"","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--16479110758573__8eb80464-480e-4783-abec-e312dd953d35-liquid-1","dosage_chart_FYgJHP","image_9CFYhK"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".image-wrap {background-color: #f9f2ed;}"],"settings":{"id":"","full_width":true,"space_around":true,"margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_around":true,"padding_top":75,"padding_bottom":75,"background":"#f9f2ed","heading_color":"#002d72","text_color":"#002d72"}},"advanced_content_pXXeNF":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"image_xdxgDi":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_size":false,"height":80,"link":"","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"liquid_twLr4p":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<h2>Why NextEvo Supplements Are The Natural Wellness Solution<\/h2><p>Discover the NextEvo Naturals range of dissolvable powders, capsules, and Gummies, crafted for easy consumption and fast absorption thanks to our proprietary <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/smartsorb\">SmartSorb™ technology<\/a> allowing more to be delivered to your body and for you to feel the benefits in a shorter space of time. \n<p>\nNextEvo's Premium Pure <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/collections\/dissolvable-cbd-powder\">Dissovable Powders<\/a> are made in the USA with all natural ingredients. These vegan wellness supplements do not contain gelatin and are gluten-free. Each pouche contains a precise dose of 20mg SmartSorb wellness with 4x absorption, so can take less to get more.\n<p>\nWhen you buy your wellness supplements from NextEvo, you know that we only use the finest, bio-available ingredients available that have been directly backed by clinical evidence and really help you to achieve your goals and push your boundaries, whatever they may be. <\/p>\n\n<a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/discount\/dissolvable30?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fdissolvable-cbd-powder\" class=\"btn btn--secondary\" style=\"background: #002D72; border-color: #002D72; color: #FFF;\">Dissolvable Powders for Drinks & Treats<\/a>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["image_xdxgDi","liquid_twLr4p"],"settings":{"id":"","full_width":false,"space_around":true,"margin_top":25,"margin_bottom":25,"padding_around":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"background":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#002d72","text_color":"#0e1111"}},"164191583148ab66dc":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"1641915831d00a823b-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How does CBD help with recovery?","text":"<p>The skin contains a high concentration of cannabinoid receptors, and when you apply CBD topically, it activates the endocannabinoid system through those receptors. The endocannabinoid system is responsible for many physiological processes, including muscle soreness, and immune function, <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/blogs\/news\/cbd-before-or-after-workout-how-cbd-can-help-your-workout\">which CBD can regulate and improve<\/a>.<\/p>"}},"4794c9ac-ba35-4b34-9fdf-1f354d679cfa":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I use CBD recovery cream alongside other CBD products?","text":"<p>Yes, you can use CBD cream with other products such as capsules, gummies and powder. But start with small amounts and build up gradually until you find the right levels for your body, and don’t exceed the recommended dosage.<\/p>"}},"196b91ac-7a99-4af0-8fc9-b94149815097":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Does CBD Make You High?","text":"<p>No - CBD will not make you high. This is because CBD is a completely different compound to that of THC (the intoxicating constituent of the cannabis plant). <\/p><p>Hemp-derived CBD products are non-intoxicating and have zero psychoactive properties. High-quality CBD products can be used safely in your daily routine to support health and promote wellbeing.<\/p>"}},"f0cd3a71-ea8d-4006-a6cf-0927a6976faf":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Is CBD Legal?","text":"<p>Yes, CBD products are legal but they must meet regulatory standards. The World Health Organization describes CBD as “generally well tolerated” and as having “a good safety profile”. <\/p><p>Therefore it is important to only use high-quality CBD products from trusted retailers. <\/p><p>NextEvo Naturals is committed to rigorous scientific research to evaluate the safety and efficacy of our Premium Pure CBD products. Our Smartsorb™ technology has undergone groundbreaking research at Colorado State University.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Our technology is currently being studied to evaluate the inflammation response on the body at different CBD dosage levels. Our commitment to research allows us to develop breakthrough technology<br\/>that is taking the CBD industry by storm.<\/p><p><\/p>"}},"805100b1-3456-4737-88a6-58a24e94bd8b":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What Makes NextEvo Naturals CBD Different?","text":"<p>At NextEvo Naturals, we take CBD and performance seriously. Our goal is to provide science-backed natural solutions that exist to improve your day-to-day wellness. That’s why our CBD products are backed by physicians and only use natural ingredients without the use of GMOs or fillers.<\/p><p>We’re dedicated to the evolution of wellness and the pursuit of enhanced quality allowing us to create CBD supplements that you can rely on wherever you are - we’ve got your back. <\/p><p>We have developed <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/blogs\/news\/innovative-cbd-technology\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Smartsorb™ technology<\/span><\/a> which allows the body to absorb NextEvo Naturals’s CBD within 10 minutes of ingesting and has over 4x the absorption rate of CBD than other common products. NextEvo Naturals guarantees a clean, fast-acting CBD product backed by scientific research.  <\/p>"}},"1641915831d00a823b-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Why choose water soluble CBD?","text":"<p>Water soluble CBD is a great choice if you’re looking for a CBD product that’s fast acting and easy to consume. Water soluble CBD is discrete and adaptable. It can easily transition into your daily routine whether you’re using it in a private, social or professional environment.<\/p>"}},"8b82310a-c71b-43da-96d3-aeed8f9093a2":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is Smartsorb™ technology?","text":"<p>Our groundbreaking Smartsorb™ technology has been developed to work with your body and increase the amount of CBD that you can absorb. This provides your body with more CBD per dose making it more effective than inferior CBD products.<\/p><p>All of our CBD products use this technology. <a href=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/smartsorb\" title=\"https:\/\/nextevo.com\/pages\/smartsorb\">Click here <\/a>to find out more about Smartsorb technology™.<\/p>"}},"b43cb2f6-9691-40b4-85ac-0c69a3285adc":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is water soluble CBD used for?","text":"<p>Water soluble CBD can be used to help with many ailments, just as with other CBD products. Our NextEvo water soluble CBD products are designed to help you be at your best, hit your personal goals and combat the stresses of daily life whatever path you’re on. It’s our aim to help you achieve next level wellness and we pride ourselves on the quality of our CBD and its ability to help you push your limits.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["1